      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `70dac6108d9dcf66db4d533ef682d9f2d35953046407166f1cb41a67e1b4ad29--recorded-crime-offenders-2015-16-cube-6-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Offenders (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2015-16\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 8 of 8\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 26a553b81e5cfcc03a5b218f5781c77adac0dc2cc07682dc54dab4da9709ecb8 | missing |\n| \"Table 1\" | c0e9ca4c8a6a6ea6cd3b0393d707265fb68530c77b299f96f4c295dccd69517a | missing |\n| \"Table 2\" | 40cfb9024484e2230fed933e30d130c6baaa5cba776ab1018a8ec0a0576e7100 | missing |\n| \"Table 3\" | 9bd34c336a5739a37285d7a60b367e221ee3288642b5fb894202a839eeb6bebd | missing |\n| \"Table 4\" | 7587ed046a61651da66e02a190bb79144dcb85930f8c6d67ff0fa8e8ddbf4572 | missing |\n| \"Table 5\" | e22e38d866340931b6cb8903cc9bf10ec18a0e8f3abd7d99da1a43b295d74f34 | missing |\n| \"Table 6\" | 1f2b90a5ef2df8363e59364873f519711a0ac69190552db4d5b1e9d17aaa8ad1 | missing |\n| \"Explanatory Notes\" | 5e5f68356a0325c5bcfc93ae4684514a9025e7ab5155daf4e5b92de42f91dc21 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
